{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmy9wHo5whDMVGiujhGf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Avi'le, I mean, son, here's how it went.\n\nI didn't decide. If I had to put a name down, I'd write **Harel, the \"כספי (שקלי)\" track**, but I want to go over it with you or with the bank before I sign anything. I'm not very sure about it.\n\n**Why that one:**\n- Harel is a big name I know. מור and אנליסט I've never heard of. מיטב I've maybe heard of.\n- On that line, next to \"מניות\" and \"מט\"ח\" it says \"0%\". I read that as no shares and no dollars.\n- \"כספי (שקלי)\" sounds like plain money in shekels, the closest thing to my deposit.\n- It says \"4.25%\" next to \"3 שנים\". I didn't work out what that means against what the bank gives me.\n- The fee says \"0.57% מהחיסכון\". I can't tell if that's a lot or a little. Most other lines were about the same, 0.55% to 0.73%.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top: \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". I picked out \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\". I didn't open \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\".\n2. A row of buttons. One says \"אג\"ח ממשלתית 3\", and government bonds I know are safe. But I couldn't find those tracks in the long list.\n3. Harel's list, then מור, אנליסט and the start of מיטב. Around the sixth screen I got tired and stopped. I never reached the end of the list.\n\n**What I didn't understand:**\n- The English letters \"S&P 500\" (I'd read them out letter by letter).\n- \"עוקב מדדים\", \"גמיש\", \"מט\"ח\", \"חשיפה\".\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", which was written instead of a number on many lines.\n- What \"0% מההפקדות\" means next to \"מהחיסכון\".\n- The little circles in turquoise and yellow. Every line has them, with the same two labels again and again. I had to read \"מניות / מט\"ח\" over on each line just to find the numbers.\n- The words \"חדש\" and \"עוד לא דווח\".\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The whole page is black with grey writing. The headings at the top of the table were hard to read even enlarged.\n- Lots of numbers on every line made me anxious.\n- Some lines say 24% or 26%. That sounds lovely, but those are the lines with \"מניות 100%\". After the fund that fell on me, I'm keeping away from them.\n- The very first thing on the page is shares and English letters. I nearly left.\n\nWill you call me this evening and we'll go over it together?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3686,"cache_read_input_tokens":11715,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3686},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ae10268-89c5-41c2-9eac-6ea3b6108ef3","uuid":"7fd9dcc6-15b4-4623-a21d-2ce2b874d371","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:12:39.469Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmy9w4uGeyVafnnTQwnn"}
